    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n105525" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τρόπ-ις</span></b> , ἡ, gen.
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τρόπεως</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>Placit.</u>
					2.4.15
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Hdn.
				<u>Epim.</u>
				135
			</span></i>; 
				Ion.
			 gen. 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τρόπιος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Od.
					19.278
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				2.96
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τρόπιδος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>EM</u>
					811.21
				</span></i>
			; dat. 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τρόπιδι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					A.R.
					1.388
				</span></i>
			; acc. 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τρόπιν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hippon.
					50
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Orph.
				<u>A.</u>
				271
			</span></i>: pl. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τρόπεις,</span> dat. 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τρόπισι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.C.
					48.38
				</span></i>
			: (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τρέπω</span>):—<i>ship's
				keel,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Od.
				5.130
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				12.421
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
			</span></i> l. c.; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τ. νεός</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Od.
					7.252
				</span></i>
			, 
			<i><span class="en">
				19.278
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πλοίου τ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arist.
					<u>Metaph.</u>
					1013a5
				</span></i>
			; and poet. <i>ship,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>Fr.</u>
				143
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τρόπεις θέσθαι</span> lay down
				<i>keels</i> for building ships, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				<u>Demetr.</u>
				43
			</span></i>; cf. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τροπιδεῖον</span>: metaph., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λέγε νυν τὴν τ. τοῦ πράγματος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ar.
					<u>V.</u>
					30
				</span></i>
			.</div>
